WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.810
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:09.080 --> 03:11.040
I came to ask for your kindness, Grandpa.

3
03:11.120 --> 03:13.160
PREVIOUSLY

4
03:13.240 --> 03:16.520
The villagers are in trouble. I think you can help them, Grandpa.

5
03:17.600 --> 03:20.760
Hathaya stole the spotlight and grabbed all his attention.

6
03:20.840 --> 03:21.680
I hate her.

7
03:22.280 --> 03:25.280
She came back here to steal our inheritance.

8
03:26.000 --> 03:28.720
I won't let her take what belongs to me.

9
03:28.800 --> 03:30.960
I want to know who Hathaya's mother

10
03:31.040 --> 03:33.880
is living with and what she does

11
03:33.960 --> 03:35.880
and whether Hathaya's grandmother is really sick.

12
03:36.960 --> 03:38.120
Is your granddaughter not here?

13
03:38.200 --> 03:39.440
It's a long story.

14
03:39.520 --> 03:42.960
If there's anything you want to tell me, I'm listening.

15
03:54.120 --> 03:55.280
Hey!

16
03:55.880 --> 03:56.960
Why are you setting those off?

17
03:57.480 --> 04:00.160
If something happens to her, you're going to jail!

18
04:00.240 --> 04:01.360
Where's your daughter?

19
04:01.440 --> 04:04.080
Hathai took the money to pay you.

20
04:04.160 --> 04:05.600
If she paid her debt,

21
04:05.680 --> 04:07.360
I wouldn't even be here!

22
04:07.440 --> 04:10.800
She left with the money yesterday. She still hasn't come back.

23
04:10.880 --> 04:12.840
You people are trying to mess with us?

24
04:12.920 --> 04:16.560
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

25
04:16.640 --> 04:17.959
Don't!

26
04:18.040 --> 04:20.880
Those are the things I use to make a living! Stop!

27
04:21.519 --> 04:24.200
This is going too far. I'm calling the police.

28
04:37.440 --> 04:40.280
Eggs! Grilled eggs here!

29
04:40.960 --> 04:43.080
Grilled eggs!

30
04:44.720 --> 04:47.920
You! Get over here!

31
04:50.440 --> 04:51.640
If you run, I'll kill you!

32
04:51.720 --> 04:53.760
If I don't run, I'll die anyway!

33
04:58.880 --> 05:00.080
After her!

34
05:01.280 --> 05:02.720
Please help Hathai!

35
05:02.800 --> 05:05.320
They're going to kill her! Please help her!

36
05:06.880 --> 05:08.480
-Please help! -Yes.

37
05:08.560 --> 05:09.680
Alright?

38
05:10.280 --> 05:11.880
Oh, Hathai.

39
05:24.800 --> 05:27.240
Those bastards! They nearly killed me!

40
05:32.040 --> 05:34.160
Damn it. Thought you were so tough, huh?

41
05:34.240 --> 05:35.280
You losers!

42
05:35.360 --> 05:36.720
Who are you calling losers?

43
05:44.840 --> 05:47.280
I wasn't talking about you.

44
05:47.360 --> 05:48.200
I meant myself.

45
05:48.280 --> 05:50.200
I warned you.

46
05:50.720 --> 05:51.840
No money,

47
05:51.920 --> 05:53.880
you die.

48
05:55.000 --> 05:56.120
Come on.

49
06:11.120 --> 06:12.120
Let's go!

50
06:15.800 --> 06:17.640
Ma'am, you're safe--

51
06:22.280 --> 06:23.760
I survived!

52
06:23.840 --> 06:25.640
Mom! Mom! Help me!

53
06:25.720 --> 06:27.240
I'm back, Mom!

54
06:28.000 --> 06:29.200
Mom!

55
06:29.280 --> 06:31.440
How can you be this awful?!

56
06:32.200 --> 06:34.280
You really are terrible!

57
06:34.360 --> 06:36.120
Why didn't you use the money to pay them back?

58
06:36.200 --> 06:37.960
Where is the money? What did you do with it?

59
06:38.040 --> 06:42.600
Oh, Mom! I gambled all of it away.

60
06:42.680 --> 06:45.520
I thought I'd win one or two million,

61
06:46.120 --> 06:49.160
but I lost everything.

62
06:49.240 --> 06:51.640
How could you do this?!

63
06:51.720 --> 06:53.880
Mom! Come on, Mom!

64
06:53.960 --> 06:55.320
I did it because

65
06:55.400 --> 06:57.800
I wanted money for your treatment.

66
06:58.400 --> 07:00.160
I don't want you to have to work anymore.

67
07:00.240 --> 07:02.520
And I want Hathaya to come back and live with us.

68
07:03.120 --> 07:04.440
I did it for us, Mom.

69
07:04.520 --> 07:06.240
I love you and my daughter.

70
07:06.320 --> 07:08.440
If you really loved me and your daughter,

71
07:08.520 --> 07:10.760
you wouldn't keep doing stupid things like this.

72
07:10.840 --> 07:12.800
All you do is cause problems.

73
07:13.400 --> 07:15.400
I don't know what to do with you anymore.

74
07:16.000 --> 07:19.120
Mom! I know I was wrong.

75
07:19.200 --> 07:21.040
I'm sorry.

76
07:25.280 --> 07:27.480
And now there's no money left to pay the debt.

77
07:27.560 --> 07:28.960
What are we going to do now?

78
07:38.640 --> 07:39.560
Mom.

79
07:41.160 --> 07:42.320
Call Hathaya.

80
07:42.400 --> 07:45.200
Tell her you've been hospitalized and need emergency surgery.

81
07:46.080 --> 07:48.080
Tell her to send money.

82
07:48.160 --> 07:51.160
Then I'll use that money to pay those people.

83
07:51.240 --> 07:53.200
Please, Mom. Call her now.

84
07:53.280 --> 07:54.520
Hathaya listens to you.

85
07:54.600 --> 07:58.000
If she doesn't have the money, she'll find a way to get it somehow.

86
07:58.080 --> 07:59.600
She's a devoted granddaughter, Mom.

87
07:59.680 --> 08:03.040
Trust me. Come on. Call her.

88
08:04.080 --> 08:05.720
Call her, Mom.

89
08:08.000 --> 08:09.080
Mom!

90
08:09.160 --> 08:11.680
When are you going to stop being so selfish?

91
08:11.760 --> 08:13.800
All you ever think about is yourself.

92
08:13.880 --> 08:16.040
Huh? You lie

93
08:16.120 --> 08:18.800
and stir up trouble just to save your own skin.

94
08:19.360 --> 08:21.880
I feel so sorry for Hathaya

95
08:21.960 --> 08:23.560
for being born as your daughter.

96
08:25.200 --> 08:27.760
She's my daughter. She's supposed to help me.

97
08:28.760 --> 08:32.159
If you won't call her, I will call her myself.

98
08:33.679 --> 08:37.080
And if she refuses to help me, I'll disown her.

99
08:37.840 --> 08:41.679
Oh, Mom! You broke the phone!

100
08:41.760 --> 08:42.799
Good!

101
08:43.320 --> 08:44.720
-Then give me yours. -No.

102
08:44.800 --> 08:47.120
-Where is it? -I won't give it to you.

103
08:47.200 --> 08:49.960
-Let go of me. I won't give it to you. -Where's your phone?

104
08:50.040 --> 08:52.360
-Stay away from me. -I'll call Hathaya.

105
08:52.440 --> 08:54.160
They're back!

106
08:54.240 --> 08:55.760
They're coming back!

107
08:58.320 --> 08:59.640
I'm out.

108
09:01.040 --> 09:02.080
Hathai!

109
09:05.840 --> 09:07.000
Grandma.

110
09:08.520 --> 09:10.160
You need to run too.

111
09:10.240 --> 09:11.680
Hurry!

112
09:11.760 --> 09:14.640
Grandma, they're already gone.

113
09:14.720 --> 09:17.440
I lied so your daughter would run away.

114
09:29.640 --> 09:30.880
Grandpa.

115
09:36.920 --> 09:39.400
Thank you so much

116
09:39.480 --> 09:40.720
for giving them a chance.

117
09:44.280 --> 09:46.320
You asked me why

118
09:46.840 --> 09:49.840
I was willing to risk my future

119
09:50.480 --> 09:53.600
on people who aren't my relatives or even people I know.

120
09:55.280 --> 09:57.720
It's because I've always remembered what you taught me.

121
10:01.200 --> 10:04.520
When I was little, you told me

122
10:05.320 --> 10:07.760
that you started with nothing,

123
10:08.600 --> 10:10.160
but you were lucky

124
10:10.800 --> 10:13.320
because someone gave you a chance to work.

125
10:14.760 --> 10:16.800
That opportunity let you build a life.

126
10:18.480 --> 10:21.000
And the housing developments you created

127
10:21.080 --> 10:23.800
have given opportunities to many other people too.

128
10:29.000 --> 10:33.480
That's only part of the reason I agreed to let them stay here.

129
10:35.160 --> 10:36.600
The main reason I was interested

130
10:37.960 --> 10:41.280
was your wager.

131
10:44.680 --> 10:49.000
Remember what you said. If any problem comes up,

132
10:49.960 --> 10:51.840
you have to leave this house

133
10:52.760 --> 10:55.360
and never set foot here again for the rest of your life.

134
10:56.600 --> 10:57.800
Yes.

135
11:18.960 --> 11:19.800
HATHAYA

136
11:28.360 --> 11:29.440
Hathaya, sweetheart?

137
11:30.200 --> 11:33.840
Yes, it's your beautiful Hathaya.

138
11:33.920 --> 11:35.520
How are you, Grandma?

139
11:36.440 --> 11:38.080
I'm fine, sweetheart.

140
11:38.680 --> 11:41.880
Grandma, I did something good today.

141
11:41.960 --> 11:44.320
I helped some villagers facing demolition.

142
11:44.400 --> 11:48.160
Then I asked Grandpa to hire them to work at the site,

143
11:48.680 --> 11:50.120
and Grandpa agreed.

144
11:50.720 --> 11:52.760
Your grandpa is a good man.

145
11:52.840 --> 11:56.080
You need to love him and take good care of him.

146
11:57.080 --> 11:59.840
I will, Grandma. I'll do my best.

147
12:00.560 --> 12:03.120
Grandma, how is Mom?

148
12:12.320 --> 12:14.600
Grandma? What's wrong?

149
12:14.680 --> 12:16.000
Why are you crying?

150
12:18.240 --> 12:20.120
I'm just overwhelmed, sweetheart.

151
12:20.200 --> 12:23.880
I'm proud that my granddaughter is a good person who helps others.

152
12:27.600 --> 12:31.160
Grandma, Mom paid off the debt already, right?

153
12:35.320 --> 12:39.160
Your mother paid it all off. You don't need to worry.

154
12:39.680 --> 12:43.480
Just focus on your work. And remember

155
12:43.560 --> 12:45.640
to be grateful to the people who help you.

156
12:47.360 --> 12:48.520
Okay, Grandma.

157
12:49.040 --> 12:53.000
I love you more than anyone in the world.

158
12:54.440 --> 12:55.880
I'm going to bed now.

159
12:56.560 --> 12:58.600
Okay. Kisses.

160
12:59.200 --> 13:00.520
Okay, sweetheart.

161
13:26.840 --> 13:28.040
Grandma,

162
13:30.040 --> 13:32.480
why didn't you just tell her the truth?

163
13:33.680 --> 13:36.160
Hathaya has suffered enough already.

164
13:36.240 --> 13:40.160
I don't want my granddaughter to worry any more than she already does.

165
13:43.720 --> 13:46.920
Grandmother and granddaughter are exactly alike.

166
13:47.800 --> 13:49.360
You know my granddaughter, don't you?

167
13:52.920 --> 13:55.880
No. So…

168
13:57.320 --> 13:59.200
What are you going to do now?

169
14:01.120 --> 14:03.600
Whatever can still be used, I'll keep using.

170
14:04.280 --> 14:05.920
Then I'll borrow some money

171
14:06.000 --> 14:09.040
to buy ingredients and start selling food again.

172
14:10.200 --> 14:13.600
But those men might come back.

173
14:14.360 --> 14:16.040
You should move somewhere else.

174
14:17.080 --> 14:19.240
Where am I supposed to go?

175
14:19.320 --> 14:21.080
I've spent my whole life

176
14:21.160 --> 14:23.280
moving from place to place. I'm tired.

177
14:24.000 --> 14:25.920
I don't have that many years left anyway.

178
14:26.000 --> 14:28.680
If I'm going to die, I might as well die here.

179
14:29.280 --> 14:33.160
Then I'll take you to file a police report.

180
14:33.880 --> 14:36.920
At least the police can keep an eye on things.

181
14:38.440 --> 14:39.400
All right.

182
14:49.400 --> 14:50.480
I'll help you, Grandma.

183
14:53.560 --> 14:54.720
I'll help.

184
15:05.920 --> 15:06.960
Here, Grandma.

185
15:08.080 --> 15:11.360
Use this as capital for your stall so you don't have to borrow.

186
15:11.440 --> 15:12.280
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

187
15:12.360 --> 15:15.960
I can't accept this. You've already gotten into enough trouble because of me.

188
15:18.120 --> 15:19.120
Grandma,

189
15:20.600 --> 15:24.280
you just taught your granddaughter about gratitude.

190
15:24.800 --> 15:26.480
My own grandma died when I was little.

191
15:27.360 --> 15:31.160
If you don't mind, could you treat me like your grandson?

192
15:31.680 --> 15:33.120
I'll take care of you.

193
15:37.840 --> 15:40.480
Please, Grandma. Take it.

194
15:41.000 --> 15:41.920
Please.

195
15:48.880 --> 15:50.680
May you prosper

196
15:50.760 --> 15:53.080
and encounter only good things in life.

197
15:53.720 --> 15:58.200
And may all the merit from your kindness go to your parents

198
15:58.280 --> 16:00.360
for raising such a good man.

199
16:04.240 --> 16:05.200
Thank you.

200
16:06.200 --> 16:09.160
I should get going.

201
16:09.240 --> 16:11.360
Take good care of yourself,

202
16:11.440 --> 16:13.840
and wait for your granddaughter to come home.

203
16:15.000 --> 16:16.000
All right.

204
16:17.360 --> 16:21.480
Wait. I still don't know your name.

205
16:22.280 --> 16:23.280
Um…

206
16:24.200 --> 16:25.160
You can call me…

207
16:28.200 --> 16:29.200
Weir.

208
16:33.080 --> 16:34.440
If you're ever around here again,

209
16:34.520 --> 16:37.800
come visit me, Weir.

210
16:49.440 --> 16:50.320
Dad.

211
16:52.120 --> 16:53.280
Have you seen the video?

212
16:53.360 --> 16:56.000
What video? I don't watch pointless nonsense.

213
16:58.080 --> 17:00.080
That video of the villagers getting evicted.

214
17:02.640 --> 17:04.079
-Boss, look at this. -I agree

215
17:04.160 --> 17:06.000
with development and the greater good,

216
17:06.599 --> 17:10.640
but I don't agree with using the majority as an excuse to ignore the minority.

217
17:11.160 --> 17:12.760
True democracy isn't just

218
17:12.839 --> 17:16.560
about listening to the majority. It also means listening to the minority.

219
17:16.640 --> 17:20.720
The majority should not be used to pressure the minority.

220
17:20.800 --> 17:24.680
We need to work together to solve this. We need to find the fairest solution

221
17:24.760 --> 17:26.000
and proceed.

222
17:30.280 --> 17:31.680
Miss Hathaya!

223
17:31.760 --> 17:33.840
You've become famous.

224
17:33.920 --> 17:37.000
Look! It's almost at a million views.

225
17:37.080 --> 17:38.720
What is it, Aunt Ann?

226
17:39.320 --> 17:43.320
Here. It's the video of you standing up for the villagers facing demolition.

227
17:43.400 --> 17:46.080
This is work time.

228
17:46.160 --> 17:48.240
Not time to sit around watching pointless videos.

229
17:49.640 --> 17:53.240
Chamoi, when you spend hours scrolling through videos,

230
17:53.320 --> 17:54.600
I never say anything.

231
17:54.680 --> 17:57.080
You're even more ridiculous than I am.

232
18:00.120 --> 18:02.080
Look, Miss Hathaya.

233
18:03.400 --> 18:04.760
Pathetic.

234
18:04.840 --> 18:08.920
Acting like some angel who helps everyone.

235
18:09.000 --> 18:11.840
I know you filmed and edited this yourself

236
18:11.920 --> 18:15.640
because you wanted to get famous online.

237
18:15.720 --> 18:16.760
Attention seeker!

238
18:17.400 --> 18:19.120
I don't even have these clips,

239
18:19.200 --> 18:21.200
and I didn't film them myself.

240
18:21.280 --> 18:24.000
It was probably one of the villagers I helped who posted them.

241
18:24.560 --> 18:27.440
Miss Hathaya, look! The views are shooting up!

242
18:27.520 --> 18:30.520
Hey! This is work time.

243
18:31.040 --> 18:33.640
Anyone caught watching videos is getting reported to Madam.

244
18:38.040 --> 18:39.520
Madam!

245
18:39.600 --> 18:41.680
Madam! Madam!

246
18:41.760 --> 18:43.640
Madam, Hathaya

247
18:43.720 --> 18:45.040
has become a TikTok star!

248
18:45.120 --> 18:47.680
She's almost at a million views!

249
18:47.760 --> 18:50.080
Stop screaming. I know. I'm watching it right now!

250
18:51.560 --> 18:54.040
-Madam! Madam! -Chamoi.

251
18:54.120 --> 18:56.280
Say one more word

252
18:56.360 --> 18:57.800
and I'll slap you!

253
18:59.840 --> 19:01.280
Hathaya

254
19:01.360 --> 19:03.360
has become the villagers' little angel.

255
19:03.880 --> 19:05.800
Everything she does gets praised.

256
19:06.520 --> 19:09.360
Chayanee, sweetheart, you need to do something.

257
19:10.680 --> 19:13.880
Mom, don't waste your time on these ridiculous clips.

258
19:13.960 --> 19:16.640
She can be an angel to a bunch of parasites all she wants.

259
19:16.720 --> 19:17.800
So what?

260
19:18.320 --> 19:21.800
Her life will never be better than mine.

261
19:26.040 --> 19:27.160
Where are you going?

262
19:27.960 --> 19:29.800
I have an important plan.

263
19:30.640 --> 19:32.080
With whom?

264
19:40.560 --> 19:42.920
Madam. Madam.

265
19:43.000 --> 19:45.200
The shares… So many people shared this!

266
19:45.280 --> 19:47.360
-Chamoi! -So many--

267
19:47.440 --> 19:48.480
Do you want to get fired?

268
19:49.640 --> 19:50.960
Get out!

269
19:51.040 --> 19:52.000
Yes Madam.

270
19:52.520 --> 19:54.640
My goodness.

271
19:58.560 --> 20:00.640
They posted that video and made me look bad.

272
20:01.720 --> 20:02.960
I'll have someone

273
20:03.880 --> 20:04.960
burn their houses down.

274
20:06.040 --> 20:09.240
Dad, don't worry.

275
20:09.320 --> 20:10.520
The video they posted

276
20:10.600 --> 20:12.960
only shows Hathaya asking for help rehousing the villagers.

277
20:13.040 --> 20:16.120
They wouldn't dare upload the part where they criticized you.

278
20:16.200 --> 20:17.680
They know they were in the wrong too.

279
20:17.760 --> 20:20.840
I'm going to have the officials tear down all their houses.

280
20:20.920 --> 20:22.760
Then we'll build the road for the public good.

281
20:23.760 --> 20:26.160
We need to score points with people in the area.

282
20:26.960 --> 20:30.360
When you run in the next election, they'll all vote for you.

283
20:32.080 --> 20:35.680
I think this is actually a good opportunity to build support.

284
20:36.960 --> 20:38.280
What are you planning?

285
20:40.080 --> 20:42.160
Hathaya is trending right now.

286
20:43.160 --> 20:47.200
The media wants to cover her story. If we use this opportunity,

287
20:47.280 --> 20:49.440
we can turn a crisis into an advantage.

288
20:57.480 --> 21:00.040
Everyone, let's work a little faster.

289
21:00.120 --> 21:02.200
The villagers will be able to move in sooner.

290
21:02.280 --> 21:03.200
Yes!

291
21:12.480 --> 21:13.800
Max, what are you doing?

292
21:15.320 --> 21:17.720
I want a selfie with a celebrity.

293
21:17.800 --> 21:19.160
You'll be unreachable soon.

294
21:19.240 --> 21:21.000
Get in.

295
21:23.000 --> 21:24.000
Boss,

296
21:24.080 --> 21:25.600
-take one for me too. -Aow,

297
21:26.600 --> 21:29.800
I think we should wait until break time. The boss might yell at us.

298
21:29.880 --> 21:31.600
He's running an errand and won't be in.

299
21:31.680 --> 21:33.080
Well, what are we waiting for?

300
21:33.160 --> 21:34.880
Come on! Come here!

301
21:34.960 --> 21:36.640
Quickly.

302
21:40.160 --> 21:41.600
-Come on, guys! -Let's go!

303
21:41.680 --> 21:44.120
Come on, everyone! We're not leaving without a fight!

304
21:44.200 --> 21:45.480
Oh? Hey, hey.

305
21:46.240 --> 21:47.360
What happened now?

306
21:47.440 --> 21:49.000
What's wrong?

307
21:49.640 --> 21:51.520
There's definitely a problem! Right, everyone?

308
21:51.600 --> 21:53.280
-Yes! -Wait.

309
21:53.360 --> 21:56.080
Everyone, calm down. What happened?

310
21:56.160 --> 21:59.720
Did they come to demolish your homes and force you out today?

311
21:59.800 --> 22:01.280
No.

312
22:01.360 --> 22:06.200
The Subdistrict Office is giving us time to finish the houses before we move.

313
22:06.280 --> 22:09.000
Then what's the problem?

314
22:09.080 --> 22:12.080
If you don't let us help build our own homes,

315
22:12.160 --> 22:13.240
then we've got a problem!

316
22:13.320 --> 22:14.480
Right, everyone?

317
22:14.560 --> 22:16.480
-Yes! -Yes!

318
22:17.000 --> 22:20.400
Hathaya, you were kind enough to help build housing for us,

319
22:20.480 --> 22:22.640
a roof over our heads.

320
22:22.720 --> 22:24.520
Please let us help build it too.

321
22:24.600 --> 22:27.720
Then what are we waiting for? Let's build our homes together!

322
22:27.800 --> 22:28.760
Come on!

323
22:28.840 --> 22:30.520
-Let's do it! -Let's do it!

324
22:30.600 --> 22:32.560
Let's go.

325
22:44.280 --> 22:47.480
Seeing everyone pitch in like this

326
22:47.560 --> 22:48.720
really warms my heart.

327
22:48.800 --> 22:50.240
Boss.

328
22:51.200 --> 22:52.040
Don't slack off.

329
22:52.120 --> 22:54.280
What, Aow? What did you say?

330
22:54.360 --> 22:57.320
Or I'll tell the boss.

331
22:58.160 --> 22:59.160
Are you threatening me?

332
22:59.240 --> 23:02.000
-Come here! -No violence.

333
23:02.600 --> 23:06.040
Take this.

334
23:06.120 --> 23:07.280
No violence.

335
23:09.040 --> 23:10.080
Come here!

336
23:11.600 --> 23:14.080
Hathaya's mother gambled away all her money

337
23:14.600 --> 23:15.600
and ran from her debts.

338
23:16.200 --> 23:18.560
Her grandmother really is sick. She has heart disease.

339
23:19.200 --> 23:22.440
She earns money to support herself and pay off debts while waiting

340
23:23.560 --> 23:25.040
for Hathaya to come home.

341
23:28.360 --> 23:29.440
Thank you.

342
23:30.240 --> 23:33.200
Everything Hathaya told you was true.

343
23:36.560 --> 23:39.480
Keep an eye on things for me.

344
23:40.400 --> 23:41.440
Yes, sir.

345
23:44.680 --> 23:48.800
Sir, have you seen Hathaya's video yet?

346
23:51.960 --> 23:53.040
May I?

347
24:00.440 --> 24:01.600
Mr. Saksit.

348
24:01.680 --> 24:03.240
Hello.

349
24:03.320 --> 24:04.400
Hello, Ms. Liu.

350
24:05.080 --> 24:07.160
What can we do for you?

351
24:07.240 --> 24:11.440
Or perhaps you'd like to buy one or two houses?

352
24:12.000 --> 24:14.960
For you, Mr. Saksit, I can give you a special price.

353
24:16.320 --> 24:19.960
I'm here to see someone special.

354
24:21.440 --> 24:23.880
Oh, I'm so sorry.

355
24:23.960 --> 24:26.280
Chayanee isn't in the office today.

356
24:26.360 --> 24:30.040
I believe she went out to discuss promoting the development.

357
24:31.640 --> 24:34.200
Actually, I'm not here to see Chayanee.

358
24:35.360 --> 24:37.640
Then who are you here to see?

359
24:37.720 --> 24:39.440
Dad is here to see Hathaya.

360
24:48.240 --> 24:49.440
Hathaya?

361
24:58.320 --> 24:59.440
Thank you.

362
25:00.120 --> 25:01.680
Do you remember me?

363
25:03.280 --> 25:04.320
Yes.

364
25:04.400 --> 25:07.440
I'm Raiwin, the Chief's son. My father really wants to meet you.

365
25:11.600 --> 25:15.240
Hello, everyone! Hello!

366
25:15.320 --> 25:17.880
Reporters. These are

367
25:17.960 --> 25:20.760
residents from my subdistrict.

368
25:20.840 --> 25:22.200
Go ahead.

369
25:22.800 --> 25:26.320
I had a plan with Raiwin. He wouldn't answer my calls, but now he's here?

370
25:26.400 --> 25:27.880
How could he do this?

371
25:28.680 --> 25:30.840
Chayanee, not yet.

372
25:31.840 --> 25:34.440
Everyone, the young woman standing here

373
25:34.520 --> 25:36.440
is Miss Hathaya.

374
25:37.040 --> 25:40.160
The villagers' angel who has been helping local residents

375
25:40.240 --> 25:41.720
and is currently going viral online.

376
25:41.800 --> 25:44.080
Go ahead. Take pictures.

377
25:47.960 --> 25:49.960
And as

378
25:50.040 --> 25:51.600
the Subdistrict Chief here,

379
25:52.200 --> 25:55.320
I would like to sincerely thank Miss Hathaya

380
25:55.400 --> 25:58.920
for her kindness in helping these villagers find both housing

381
25:59.000 --> 26:00.480
and employment.

382
26:00.560 --> 26:03.520
I hope everyone here

383
26:03.600 --> 26:05.320
will look to Miss Hathaya

384
26:05.400 --> 26:08.800
as an example. Let's give her another round of applause.

385
26:08.880 --> 26:10.160
Thank you.

386
26:12.400 --> 26:13.760
Father, did you stop by for work?

387
26:15.040 --> 26:18.280
Chayanee, take Grandpa into the office.

388
26:18.880 --> 26:22.000
No. I want to know what's happening.

389
26:22.840 --> 26:26.240
I'm Raiwin. I serve as the Chief's assistant.

390
26:27.000 --> 26:29.200
On behalf of the Subdistrict Office,

391
26:29.720 --> 26:34.160
I'd like to present this gift basket to Hathaya as a token of our appreciation.

392
26:34.240 --> 26:35.880
And I hope that in the future,

393
26:35.960 --> 26:37.800
we can continue working together

394
26:37.880 --> 26:40.160
to help improve our community.

395
26:43.400 --> 26:44.440
Okay.

396
26:44.520 --> 26:46.560
Pictures! Stand closer together.

397
26:47.160 --> 26:49.360
This is my son. He's pleased to meet you all.

398
26:49.440 --> 26:52.160
-Please look at this camera. -Take pictures.

399
26:52.240 --> 26:53.600
Yes.

400
26:54.760 --> 26:56.960
You can interview her now.

401
26:57.040 --> 26:59.800
-Go ahead and interview Miss Hathaya. -Thank you.

402
26:59.880 --> 27:01.080
You can interview her now.

403
27:05.280 --> 27:08.080
People online have been praising you as an angel

404
27:08.160 --> 27:12.000
because of your kindness. Why did you decide to help the villagers?

405
27:12.080 --> 27:14.600
That's right. These days, so many people

406
27:14.680 --> 27:16.880
only think about themselves.

407
27:16.960 --> 27:19.680
Why did you choose to help them?

408
27:20.520 --> 27:21.520
She's stupid.

409
27:21.600 --> 27:24.760
She won't know what to say. Let her embarrass herself at the mic.

410
27:25.360 --> 27:28.680
First, I'd like to correct one thing.

411
27:29.240 --> 27:30.720
I'm not an angel.

412
27:30.800 --> 27:34.320
I'm just an ordinary person like everyone else.

413
27:34.400 --> 27:37.120
If you ask why I decided to help…

414
27:38.120 --> 27:40.280
I've struggled in life too.

415
27:40.360 --> 27:41.800
That's why I understand them.

416
27:44.960 --> 27:47.640
I simply wanted to solve the problem in front of me

417
27:47.720 --> 27:50.000
and find the best possible solution for everyone.

418
27:50.080 --> 27:51.400
How do you feel about

419
27:51.480 --> 27:53.600
the villagers and people online

420
27:53.680 --> 27:55.720
calling you an angel?

421
27:55.800 --> 27:58.640
I'm very grateful for every comment,

422
27:58.720 --> 28:01.920
but I really can't take the credit

423
28:02.000 --> 28:05.280
because none of my ideas would have happened

424
28:05.360 --> 28:09.400
without the approval of Mr. Pichai, the owner of this project.

425
28:10.200 --> 28:12.280
Mr. Pichai provided the land

426
28:12.360 --> 28:14.840
where the villagers can stay and work here.

427
28:14.920 --> 28:17.640
He helped them without expecting anything in return.

428
28:17.720 --> 28:21.200
The housing development he created has a slogan,

429
28:21.280 --> 28:23.080
"The Family."

430
28:23.160 --> 28:25.640
Family means helping one another.

431
28:25.720 --> 28:29.720
And his idea of family doesn't mean only a father, mother, and children.

432
28:29.800 --> 28:31.960
Our family is bigger than that.

433
28:32.040 --> 28:35.120
We are a community. We are a society that helps one another.

434
28:36.280 --> 28:39.400
If you reporters would like more details,

435
28:40.120 --> 28:42.280
you can interview him directly.

436
28:42.800 --> 28:45.400
-May I? -There he is.

437
28:50.520 --> 28:52.560
Sir, may we interview you?

438
28:53.160 --> 28:54.680
Of course.

439
28:54.760 --> 28:56.520
How long will you allow them to stay here?

440
28:56.600 --> 28:57.640
Well…

441
29:01.520 --> 29:03.200
Excuse me. I need to get back to work.

442
29:03.280 --> 29:04.320
Of course.

443
29:19.360 --> 29:21.800
Max, share the fruit with everyone.

444
29:22.600 --> 29:24.800
The Chief gave it to you. You should keep it.

445
29:24.880 --> 29:26.280
You don't want any?

446
29:27.320 --> 29:28.960
It's expensive stuff.

447
29:29.040 --> 29:31.080
Of course I want some. Looks delicious!

448
29:31.160 --> 29:32.240
Thank you!

449
29:32.320 --> 29:33.880
Okay.

450
29:33.960 --> 29:36.000
-Make sure you share. -I'm not sharing!

451
29:42.000 --> 29:43.280
Very impressive.

452
29:43.360 --> 29:45.280
Where did you study acting?

453
29:45.360 --> 29:47.920
You sure know how to put on a show and talk a good game.

454
29:48.520 --> 29:49.600
Flawless performance.

455
29:49.680 --> 29:51.080
If you just came to be sarcastic,

456
29:51.160 --> 29:53.320
excuse me. I have work to do.

457
29:54.480 --> 29:55.360
Wait!

458
29:55.440 --> 29:56.960
What?

459
30:01.320 --> 30:04.960
I wanted to thank you on behalf of the villagers.

460
30:08.480 --> 30:11.080
That sounds really strange coming from you.

461
30:11.800 --> 30:14.000
Then get back to work.

462
30:14.520 --> 30:17.920
Don't think being a good person means you can slack off. Go!

463
30:19.640 --> 30:22.840
Now that sounds like the real Ramil.

464
30:22.920 --> 30:24.040
Much more familiar.

465
30:46.200 --> 30:48.120
Why did you come see me?

466
30:49.320 --> 30:53.160
If you're so impressed with Hathaya, then go see her.

467
30:56.400 --> 30:58.360
I don't have feelings for your cousin.

468
31:00.400 --> 31:04.160
If you don't, then why are you getting involved with her?

469
31:06.440 --> 31:07.880
I hate her.

470
31:09.560 --> 31:13.280
Dad wants me to run in the next election.

471
31:13.880 --> 31:16.920
So we need to ride Hathaya's popularity to build support.

472
31:24.520 --> 31:25.440
Hey.

473
31:28.080 --> 31:29.560
You're the only one I have.

474
31:40.840 --> 31:43.760
I need to be the most important woman in your life.

475
31:44.520 --> 31:46.680
And the only one.

476
31:55.040 --> 31:57.080
I'm not going to ask you to believe my words.

477
31:58.680 --> 32:02.520
I'll show you how much I love you.

478
32:15.040 --> 32:17.560
Come on in.

479
32:18.160 --> 32:19.200
You can come inside now.

480
32:19.280 --> 32:20.360
Let's go.

481
32:20.440 --> 32:21.440
Come on.

482
32:21.520 --> 32:24.000
-Go. Come on in. -Let's go.

483
32:27.120 --> 32:28.840
Come on, guys.

484
32:30.080 --> 32:31.400
Wow.

485
32:32.320 --> 32:33.440
-So cute. -Coming through.

486
32:34.400 --> 32:36.680
-Nice work, Max. -Let's go.

487
32:54.480 --> 32:56.360
This is your place now.

488
32:57.200 --> 32:59.160
No one is going to force you out again.

489
33:00.480 --> 33:02.200
We have a place to live now, everyone!

490
33:02.280 --> 33:03.760
Give yourselves a big hand!

491
33:05.560 --> 33:07.840
I'm so happy.

492
33:07.920 --> 33:10.640
We don't have to live on the street anymore.

493
33:11.160 --> 33:12.200
Aw.

494
33:13.200 --> 33:15.760
No more homeless life.

495
33:16.360 --> 33:18.000
Thank you so much.

496
33:18.080 --> 33:20.120
Put the eggs right here.

497
33:20.200 --> 33:21.760
Thank you.

498
33:21.840 --> 33:23.680
Please put it there.

499
33:23.760 --> 33:25.600
-Alright. -This can go there.

500
33:25.680 --> 33:28.720
Thank you very much.

501
33:28.800 --> 33:29.880
Oh.

502
33:41.160 --> 33:43.640
Please let us live here in peace and happiness.

503
33:44.280 --> 33:46.400
Sadhu.

504
33:54.960 --> 33:57.600
And may our angel protect us too.

505
34:03.480 --> 34:05.520
Something delicious.

506
34:05.600 --> 34:07.120
-What do you want? -Frog?

507
34:07.200 --> 34:09.080
Bullfrog?

508
34:12.480 --> 34:16.760
All homeowners, please come over here for a group photo!

509
34:16.840 --> 34:18.280
-Come on. -Everyone.

510
34:18.360 --> 34:20.239
Come on.

511
34:20.320 --> 34:22.080
Come on.

512
34:23.280 --> 34:24.480
Now.

513
34:24.560 --> 34:26.480
Come in.

514
34:26.560 --> 34:28.920
-One-- -Wait!

515
34:29.440 --> 34:31.040
Come take the picture with us.

516
34:31.120 --> 34:33.040
-It's okay. -Come on.

517
34:33.120 --> 34:34.520
-Come in. -No.

518
34:34.600 --> 34:35.520
Let's take picture.

519
34:35.600 --> 34:37.480
-Come on. -You helped build this house for me.

520
34:37.560 --> 34:38.920
That makes this your home too.

521
34:39.000 --> 34:40.600
Yes.

522
34:40.679 --> 34:42.960
All right, ready?

523
34:43.040 --> 34:45.159
One, two, three!

524
34:46.000 --> 34:48.800
Okay, one more! One, two, three!

525
34:48.880 --> 34:51.960
Smile! One, two, three!

526
34:52.040 --> 34:53.840
Wait!

527
34:53.920 --> 34:55.040
Hey, come join us.

528
34:56.600 --> 35:00.520
No. I'm busy. I have to get back to work.

529
35:01.120 --> 35:04.800
Everyone, there's one very important person we can't forget.

530
35:04.880 --> 35:05.720
Ramil.

531
35:06.640 --> 35:08.360
A round of applause, please.

532
35:08.440 --> 35:10.120
Yeah!

533
35:11.200 --> 35:13.840
Ramil supervised all of the construction.

534
35:13.920 --> 35:16.680
And he'll also be the supervisor taking care of all of us.

535
35:16.760 --> 35:19.080
Boss, please look after us.

536
35:19.160 --> 35:22.280
Please take care of us.

537
35:23.160 --> 35:24.360
Make yourselves at home.

538
35:24.440 --> 35:26.520
Where are you going?

539
35:26.600 --> 35:28.400
To work.

540
35:29.680 --> 35:31.720
You have to welcome the new members first.

541
35:33.640 --> 35:35.200
No. I don't know what to say.

542
35:35.280 --> 35:38.600
My boss isn't very good at talking, but he's a great dancer!

543
35:38.680 --> 35:40.400
-Huh? -Really?

544
35:40.480 --> 35:42.200
Then…

545
35:42.280 --> 35:45.040
Show us some moves, boss!

546
35:45.120 --> 35:46.600
No way!

547
36:00.040 --> 36:01.080
That's enough.

548
36:03.000 --> 36:04.360
Pictures!

549
36:04.440 --> 36:06.920
-Come on. -Come on.

550
36:07.000 --> 36:08.240
Come on.

551
36:08.320 --> 36:09.880
Let's take pictures.

552
36:10.880 --> 36:13.040
Come here. One, two, three!

553
36:24.440 --> 36:26.920
Hey! Where are you going?

554
36:27.520 --> 36:28.840
To work.

555
36:29.360 --> 36:32.240
And don't ever do that again.

556
36:32.840 --> 36:35.280
Do what?

557
36:35.360 --> 36:38.640
Well, making me dance.

558
36:39.800 --> 36:41.040
Why?

559
36:41.680 --> 36:42.720
It was cute.

560
36:43.320 --> 36:46.520
No. I was embarrassed.

561
36:48.360 --> 36:52.160
Okay. I won't do it again.

562
37:02.960 --> 37:04.640
Why do you go this far for people?

563
37:09.160 --> 37:10.640
MODERN SINGLE-STORY HOME DEVELOPMENT

564
37:14.120 --> 37:17.200
The model home is finished, and the first phase of the development is ready.

565
37:17.280 --> 37:22.040
I want to launch the campaign. We'll hire a famous actor for a photoshoot.

566
37:23.680 --> 37:25.440
These days,

567
37:25.960 --> 37:28.240
I think we should find newer ways

568
37:28.800 --> 37:31.680
to reach customers directly. Wouldn't that be better?

569
37:31.760 --> 37:33.440
Father,

570
37:33.520 --> 37:35.880
Chayanee has thought this through carefully.

571
37:35.960 --> 37:38.640
These days, people love celebrities

572
37:38.720 --> 37:41.200
and want to copy everything they do.

573
37:41.280 --> 37:44.440
That's true. I follow celebrities too.

574
37:44.520 --> 37:47.960
When I see what they eat or buy, I want it too.

575
37:53.080 --> 37:55.160
Grandpa.

576
37:57.360 --> 37:59.000
Please sign it.

577
38:00.040 --> 38:02.160
Then I can start today.

578
38:09.920 --> 38:12.760
Sir, there are a lot of customers at the model home.

579
38:22.240 --> 38:24.120
Father, look.

580
38:24.200 --> 38:25.800
Chayanee hasn't even started her campaign,

581
38:25.880 --> 38:27.720
and it's already bringing us good luck.

582
38:28.720 --> 38:31.120
Customers are pouring in to reserve houses.

583
38:31.200 --> 38:33.200
Once I finish the PR campaign,

584
38:33.280 --> 38:35.360
the first phase will probably sell out instantly.

585
38:38.960 --> 38:40.120
Oh.

586
38:40.680 --> 38:42.600
-Hello. -Hello.

587
38:42.680 --> 38:44.480
I saw your interview the other day.

588
38:44.560 --> 38:46.480
My wife and I became interested in this place.

589
38:46.560 --> 38:49.680
To be honest, we were hesitant at first.

590
38:49.760 --> 38:51.400
Housing developments are all the same.

591
38:51.480 --> 38:54.040
But we came because I liked your philosophy

592
38:54.120 --> 38:55.760
to help people and give opportunities.

593
38:55.840 --> 38:59.840
Thank you for placing your trust in us.

594
39:00.360 --> 39:03.080
I assure you that every home is built to a high standard.

595
39:03.160 --> 39:06.320
And we'll take care of you after the sale as if you were part of our family.

596
39:07.320 --> 39:10.400
Then there's nothing left to think about. I'll put down a deposit today.

597
39:12.080 --> 39:14.120
Where's the worker named Hathaya?

598
39:15.120 --> 39:16.200
Why?

599
39:16.280 --> 39:19.800
Did Hathaya cause some kind of problem for you?

600
39:19.880 --> 39:20.760
Oh no!

601
39:20.840 --> 39:23.080
We sincerely apologize.

602
39:23.160 --> 39:26.080
That worker is always causing trouble.

603
39:44.360 --> 39:47.000
Grandpa, why did you call me here?

604
39:47.520 --> 39:51.760
Did I do something wrong?

605
39:53.840 --> 39:55.400
Hathaya,

606
39:55.480 --> 39:57.840
you're even prettier in person than you are in the video.

607
39:57.920 --> 40:00.880
My boyfriend hardly ever shares anything online,

608
40:00.960 --> 40:04.760
but he liked and shared your video with all his friends.

609
40:04.840 --> 40:06.000
I like the way you think.

610
40:06.080 --> 40:08.920
You said what people all over Thailand are feeling.

611
40:09.560 --> 40:12.680
Officials need to take a hard look at how they do their jobs too.

612
40:12.760 --> 40:14.800
I cried when I watched your video.

613
40:14.880 --> 40:17.080
My life wasn't that different from theirs.

614
40:17.160 --> 40:19.000
I only have what I have today

615
40:19.080 --> 40:21.320
because someone gave me an opportunity.

616
40:21.400 --> 40:24.480
Thank you. And thank you on their behalf too.

617
40:24.560 --> 40:26.600
You don't need to thank me.

618
40:27.360 --> 40:28.440
You should thank Mr. Pichai.

619
40:29.560 --> 40:32.480
He is always willing to give people opportunities and support them.

620
40:32.560 --> 40:35.880
We decided to buy here because of your kindness

621
40:36.400 --> 40:38.520
and Mr. Pichai's values.

622
40:40.480 --> 40:43.400
I believe that when workers put their hearts into what they do,

623
40:43.480 --> 40:46.400
the houses they build will turn out well. They'll become perfect homes.

624
40:47.000 --> 40:49.640
I'm going to promote this development to my friends

625
40:49.720 --> 40:51.760
and everyone I know.

626
40:51.840 --> 40:54.160
I won't charge you a single baht in commission.

627
40:55.080 --> 40:57.720
Thank you so much. Thank you very much.

628
40:58.520 --> 41:00.000
Thank you very much.

629
41:02.800 --> 41:04.560
Stop filming! Let's go!

630
41:06.000 --> 41:07.160
Thank you.

631
41:10.920 --> 41:13.280
You're adorable.

632
41:13.360 --> 41:14.720
So happy to meet you.

633
41:14.800 --> 41:18.240
After the customers leave, bring Hathaya to see me in the office.

634
41:18.840 --> 41:19.880
Yes, sir.

635
41:20.400 --> 41:21.320
Thank you.

636
41:27.400 --> 41:28.240
MODERN SINGLE-STORY HOME DEVELOPMENT

637
41:28.320 --> 41:30.320
ONLY FIVE UNITS REMAINING

638
41:30.400 --> 41:32.680
I've already spoken to the actor.

639
41:32.760 --> 41:34.560
Grandpa, please approve the budget,

640
41:34.640 --> 41:36.760
then I'll bring him in for the photoshoot right away.

641
41:38.560 --> 41:40.440
Please, Father.

642
41:43.360 --> 41:46.600
Grandpa, did you want to see me?

643
41:47.200 --> 41:49.960
After today, you don't have to work on site anymore.

644
41:53.200 --> 41:55.200
You're sending Hathaya home, right?

645
41:56.280 --> 41:59.200
Probably for the best. She's done nothing but cause trouble.

646
42:00.240 --> 42:03.040
So go back to your life in the countryside.

647
42:03.720 --> 42:06.200
I'm bringing Hathaya into the office to help with the work.

648
42:13.000 --> 42:16.600
Grandpa, do you mean you want Hathaya to make copies and deliver documents?

649
42:16.680 --> 42:18.920
I want Hathaya to be your assistant.

650
42:19.440 --> 42:21.440
You two will work together on promoting the project.

651
42:25.400 --> 42:27.520
This plan costs more than necessary.

652
42:28.120 --> 42:31.480
We can already reach customers directly through social media.

653
42:32.000 --> 42:35.440
And Hathaya has already laid the groundwork.

654
42:36.040 --> 42:39.280
Build on what you've already started and come up with a PR plan.

655
42:40.920 --> 42:42.200
Yes, Grandpa.

656
42:43.800 --> 42:46.960
Father, these houses cost millions.

657
42:47.040 --> 42:49.440
Using only social media advertising

658
42:49.520 --> 42:51.320
makes the project look cheap.

659
42:52.400 --> 42:55.280
Today's reservations already proved

660
42:55.840 --> 42:58.000
that we don't need to spend that much money.

661
42:59.360 --> 43:02.000
Marketing based on trust

662
43:02.080 --> 43:04.040
and sincerity is important too.

663
43:04.640 --> 43:09.440
And if you really think the project needs a spokesperson,

664
43:10.840 --> 43:13.040
Hathaya would be the right person for it.

665
43:24.720 --> 43:26.520
I agree with Grandpa.

666
43:27.920 --> 43:30.840
Maybe we should try something new.

667
43:31.800 --> 43:34.760
I believe Hathaya will do a great job.

668
43:36.640 --> 43:38.920
Let's work together.

669
43:42.000 --> 43:44.480
Of course. I'll do my very best.

670
43:49.440 --> 43:51.640
I'll give it everything I have, Grandpa.

671
43:53.400 --> 43:56.640
Ramil, I want you to speed up the construction.

672
43:57.200 --> 43:59.720
I believe sales are going to increase after this.

673
44:01.320 --> 44:02.320
Yes, sir.

674
44:12.880 --> 44:15.880
Whoa. Hey.

675
44:17.480 --> 44:20.640
What happened? Calm down.

676
44:21.280 --> 44:23.680
Grandpa is letting Hathaya work in marketing.

677
44:23.760 --> 44:26.240
Soon I'll be reporting to her.

678
44:29.320 --> 44:33.040
Your cousin is… pretty capable.

679
44:35.400 --> 44:37.720
She'll probably be a big help to your grandpa.

680
44:38.320 --> 44:40.680
So now you think she's better than me too?!

681
44:41.720 --> 44:44.240
That's not what I mean. Those are two different things.

682
44:45.040 --> 44:47.560
Calm down. Sit.

683
44:51.920 --> 44:56.440
Instead of getting angry, you should be happy someone is coming to help.

684
44:56.520 --> 45:00.760
Your grandpa will still put you in charge of her.

685
45:04.080 --> 45:05.720
You're right.

686
45:07.280 --> 45:11.400
Raiwin, I want you to make our relationship public to Grandpa.

687
45:11.920 --> 45:15.760
I think the sooner we get married,

688
45:15.840 --> 45:19.120
the sooner Grandpa might hand the business over to us.

689
45:22.720 --> 45:24.720
You think much further ahead than I do.

690
45:26.040 --> 45:27.440
You're amazing.

691
45:29.280 --> 45:31.200
I have to do everything I can

692
45:32.480 --> 45:34.080
before Hathaya

693
45:34.600 --> 45:36.480
steals what belongs to me.

694
45:39.400 --> 45:42.120
-Okay. -Give her a big hand!

695
45:44.640 --> 45:47.280
One, two, three! Yeah!

696
45:52.440 --> 45:53.280
Dad,

697
45:53.880 --> 45:56.560
there's something important I need to talk to you about.

698
45:56.640 --> 45:59.080
I have something to discuss with you too.

699
45:59.840 --> 46:01.120
You go first.

700
46:01.200 --> 46:04.760
You already know Chayanee and I have been

701
46:04.840 --> 46:06.600
seeing each other for a while, right?

702
46:08.720 --> 46:09.560
So?

703
46:10.400 --> 46:13.480
Mr. Pichai is very protective of his granddaughter.

704
46:15.280 --> 46:19.280
I'd like you to talk to him

705
46:19.360 --> 46:22.560
and ask for his permission for me to seriously date Chayanee.

706
46:23.160 --> 46:25.680
Mr. Pichai's granddaughter?

707
46:29.560 --> 46:31.840
That family is worth hundreds of millions.

708
46:33.920 --> 46:37.280
And since we're in politics, it benefits us to have connections in construction.

709
46:40.480 --> 46:44.840
It'll keep the wealth in the family.

710
47:00.960 --> 47:04.240
A construction foreman like you belongs at the work site.

711
47:05.600 --> 47:09.080
A respectable mansion like this isn't a place for someone as low-class as you.

712
47:16.080 --> 47:17.720
Thank you for the advice.

713
47:19.040 --> 47:22.160
And where should someone like you be?

714
47:22.240 --> 47:24.040
Don't get smart with me.

715
47:24.120 --> 47:28.240
You're the Chief. You should be at the Subdistrict Office.

716
47:28.880 --> 47:32.160
Do your job and make your salary worth the taxpayers' money.

717
47:32.240 --> 47:34.840
Don't go around courting businesspeople

718
47:34.920 --> 47:36.280
for your own benefit.

719
47:36.360 --> 47:37.960
-Ramil! -What are you doing here?

720
47:40.480 --> 47:41.840
I'm picking Hathaya up for work.

721
47:42.480 --> 47:46.640
Dad and I have an appointment with Mr. Pichai. We called ahead.

722
47:47.160 --> 47:49.560
Dad, I'll go get the gift basket.

723
47:49.640 --> 47:50.640
No.

724
47:52.680 --> 47:53.640
You.

725
47:54.600 --> 47:56.560
Go get the flower basket from the car for me.

726
48:00.720 --> 48:02.640
Didn't you hear what I said?

727
48:03.600 --> 48:07.000
At least, you should remember everything I did for you when I raised you.

728
48:08.440 --> 48:09.480
Go.

729
48:15.000 --> 48:16.080
Yes, sir.

730
48:29.160 --> 48:30.640
Chayanee, sweetheart.

731
48:30.720 --> 48:32.840
Raiwin brought Mr. Saksit. They're already here.

732
48:34.240 --> 48:35.920
Mom, go and welcome the guests.

733
48:36.000 --> 48:37.640
I just need to touch up a little more.

734
48:38.880 --> 48:40.600
I'm so excited.

735
48:40.680 --> 48:43.240
My lady is finally going to introduce her husband.

736
48:44.200 --> 48:45.040
-Chamoi! -Yes?

737
48:45.920 --> 48:49.240
That's inappropriate. She's just introducing her boyfriend.

738
48:51.040 --> 48:51.880
Yes. Boyfriend.

739
48:51.960 --> 48:53.920
Go downstairs and take care of the guests!

740
48:55.400 --> 48:56.720
Yes, ma'am.

741
48:59.800 --> 49:00.640
Hurry up, sweetheart.

742
49:01.640 --> 49:02.760
Okay.

743
49:09.080 --> 49:11.600
Mr. Saksit, is there something you wanted to discuss?

744
49:14.120 --> 49:16.840
I'll get straight to the point.

745
49:18.920 --> 49:21.120
My son Raiwin

746
49:21.200 --> 49:23.360
has feelings for your granddaughter.

747
49:25.080 --> 49:28.040
He asked me to come and ask you

748
49:28.120 --> 49:30.000
for permission so they can do this properly.

749
49:30.080 --> 49:33.280
I understand that love and attraction are personal matters.

750
49:34.240 --> 49:37.640
But I admire young people who show respect

751
49:38.440 --> 49:40.000
to the woman's elders.

752
49:40.640 --> 49:41.560
Raiwin.

753
49:44.720 --> 49:46.480
Thank you, Mr. Pichai.

754
49:52.880 --> 49:53.960
I…

755
49:55.040 --> 49:59.560
I would like to ask your permission to date Hathaya.

756
50:13.400 --> 50:16.560
And now she's trying to steal the man I love.

757
50:17.080 --> 50:20.920
NEXT EPISODE

758
50:21.000 --> 50:22.720
I hate her.

759
50:23.760 --> 50:27.440
Watch yourself. Your little sister might not be too happy.

760
50:27.520 --> 50:30.000
I'll get Pong to drag her straight to hell.

761
51:29.880 --> 51:30.760
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
